{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42211","headline":"寄外甥苗武仲 · 徐铉","name":"寄外甥苗武仲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"放逐今来涨海边，亲情多在凤台前。\n且将聚散爲闲事，须信华枯是偶然。\n蝉噪疎林村倚郭，鸟飞残照水连天。\n此中唯欠韩康伯，共对秋风咏数篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}